section.t:
A PSEA-conformant tier that establishes session-scoped human authorization (Tier S; see
          ) MUST require equivalent presence Evidence at
          session bootstrap, cryptographically bound to the session signing context.

section.sourcecode:
{
  "provider": "<string from IANA-managed registry>",
  "token":    "<base64 or platform-defined opaque token>"
}

ul.li:
The Attester's hardware-bound signing key is available and the platform user-verification
          ceremony (where applicable) has completed contemporaneously with signing (see
          ).

